stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SourceActive
    SourceActive --> TargetPrepared: standby anchor has same IP / drops traffic
    TargetPrepared --> Copying: target ready / conntrack precopy
    Copying --> GuestPaused: QEMU pre-switchover
    GuestPaused --> TargetActive: forward route / activate target / fence source
    TargetActive --> Adopted: QEMU transfer complete / exact target adopted
    Adopted --> RetiredSource: make-before-break routes / forwarding grace
    RetiredSource --> [*]
    TargetPrepared --> SourceActive: abort / remove target
    Copying --> SourceActive: abort / preserve source
    GuestPaused --> SourceActive: undo failed switch before continuing source
